    <h3>Reference Docs</h3>
    <p>Need a deeper explanation? These pages cover the same concepts:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><a href="../docs/unit-09/index.html">Unit 9: Data &amp; Systems</a> — bias and fair data in the CED</li>
        <li><a href="../data/playtests.csv">Playtest dataset (CSV)</a> — audit it yourself</li>
        <li><a href="9.5.html">9.5 Datasets: Insights from Playtest Data</a> — the lesson that taught you to read it</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Next: <a href="9.7.html">9.7 — Computer Systems: What Runs Your Game</a></p>
</div>`;
